  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Whenever a creature you can see starts its turn within 30 feet of you while your Rage is active, you can take a Reaction to summon spectral branches of the World Tree around it. It must succeed on a Strength saving throw (DC 8 plus your Strength modifier and Proficiency Bonus) or be teleported to an unoccupied space you can see within 5 feet of you, or to the nearest unoccupied space you can see. After it teleports, you can reduce its Speed to 0 until the end of the current turn.</p>",
